<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:14px;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_04" class="mktoText"> 
<p><span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">In times like this, our top priority is to weather the storm. But we must also make ourselves better prepared for the challenges to come and be ready to capitalize when the travel market comes roaring back.</span><br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#48B985; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:16px;" class="em_green"> 
