text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">From heli-fishing to hot tubs, Nimmo Bay has an experience for everyone.<span style="font-size: 16px;"> L<span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; 
text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">earn more about this unique resort, how they are responding to the COVID-19 restrictions on travel, and what they have planned for the future.</span></span></span><br /></p> 
</div></td> 
