<div id="text_07a6a94280-e60f-4d4e-a823-9bef0aea890f" class="mktoText"> 
<p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Elite Havens&nbsp;<span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">is Asia's market leader in high-end villa vacations. We caught up with Jon Stonham, CEO, about how he stays connected to guest feedback and why travelers who try a villa vacation rarely go back.</span></span><br /></p> 
</div></td> 
